&lt;td&gt;Vendor servers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;fal's platform&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Does user media leave the device&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;No&lt;/td&gt;
