&lt;td&gt;Yes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;What is being compared&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;On-device SDK, licensed by a token in the client app&lt;/td&gt;
